window.products.push({"id":924018,"name":"Ovente Car Electric Immersion Heater for Tea Coffee & Soup, 150 Watt Power Portable Travel Submersible Instant Hot Water Stainless Steel Warmer, Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615Jvax2BRL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your Powerful Kettle Minus the Bulk Take your time: Enjoy your early morning newspaper read and hot cup of coffee without rush through Ovente Car Electric Immersion Liquid Heater CH112 Series! With this handy tool, you do not have to get up and reheat your beverages in a microwave. Just bring your to-go mug with your beverage. Then, immerse the electric heater to keep your drink hot, clip it onto your cup, and plug it in! Unplug when it reaches your desired temperature. Remember to wait at least 15 seconds before you remove the tool from the liquid. For Other Liquids You can use this one to heat other food and beverages other than water, such as teas, coffees, and soup broths. Note that this is recommended for heating liquids with thin, water-like consistency only, not for thick mixtures or fluids. 2 Heaters in One Package Save more with our heaters! This package includes two car immersion liquid heaters. You can use one for your apartment and leave the other one in your house. Created from Prime-Quality Materials This heater is made of stainless steel and heavy-duty plastic. The plastic won’t easily warp or melt and the steel won’t rust even after years of use. Key Features: 150W (12V): Heats up fast Weight: 0.3 lbs Stainless steel Heavy-duty plastic Compact and lightweight CAUTION: ALWAYS SUBMERGE IN WATER BEFORE PLUGGING AND UNPLUGGING.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615Jvax2BRL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ovente","source_asin":"B0B1L3WYJD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1L3WYJD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1L3WYJD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
