window.products.push({"id":924059,"name":"LINSY LIVING Sherpa Full Mattress Pad, Pillow Top Mattress Topper Full Size, Warm Sherpa Fleece Cover, Soft Spiral Fiber Filling, Elastic Straps","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wNWnxkzHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Toasty & Plushy: Do you always go to bed with cold hands and cold feet? What you need is a LINSY LIVING sherpa full size mattress pad under you. It can make your bed toasty and cozy, warm up your body, and let you sleep faster and sweeter in winter. Soft & Fluffy: Quilted with super soft 7D spiral fiber, our mattress pad full can maximize the soft feeling. The baffle box design assures the thickness and reduces the cold spot with the same amount of down alternative filled in each pocket. Together you could get soft and fluffy feeling like sleeping in a marshmallow. Multi Combination: Besides using this sherpa mattress topper alone on your bed, the button design on 4 corners of this sherpa mattress pad makes it possible to use it with our pillow top mattress topper. In winter, take down the top layer of the pillowtop mattress topper, replace it with this bed topper and fixed it using the buttons, then you would have a thick, marshmallow soft and warm full bed. Anti-Slip Design: Elastic bands on 4 corners of the full size bed topper to secure it on your mattress and prevent it from sliding off. Machine Washable: LINSY LIVING mattress pad is convenient for daily maintenance, it is completely machine washable. Wash Guide: wash in cold temperature, mild mode, do not bleach, do not dry clean, do not iron, tumble dry in low setting. 5 Years Warranty: 30 days trial protects your rights as a consumer. We also provide a 5-year warranty for all of our customers, so if you have any questions or unsatisfied with the sherpa mattress topper, you can contact LINSY LIVING for support, we are 7/24 for you. *Please note: Our full mattress topper is compressed into the package, we recommend shake it before usage, this could help the mattress pad fluff up faster.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wNWnxkzHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINSY LIVING","source_asin":"B0BRD1TBRT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRD1TBRT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRD1TBRT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
