window.products.push({"id":924083,"name":"Large Kitchen Drawer Organizer - Expandable Bamboo Drawer Dividers (17\" - 21.5\") - Adjustable Separators for Kitchen, Clothes, Dresser, Bedroom, Bathr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NfRTGZp3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"- PLEASE MEASURE YOUR DRAWER FIRST - The deep drawer organizer set comes with 6 adjustable drawer separators, each divider measuring 17.7 - 22” x 2.6\". Extra convenient in the kitchen as drawer dividers for large utensils such as ladles, spatulas, and more. MULTIPURPOSE DRAWER ORGANIZERS - This set of drawer dividers will keep your drawers neatly organized so you can find what you need right away. The bamboo drawer organizer works as your custom organizer for anything, from cutlery to lingerie and looks attractive in any room: kitchen, bathroom, office or bedroom. EXPANDABLE & ADJUSTABLE UTENSIL ORGANIZER - Our storage drawer organizer fits almost any drawer in your house because the length expands from 17.7 - 22”. The beauty of the utensil drawer organizer isn’t only in the expandable length, but that they can be stacked in deeper drawers. (Each is 2.6” deep.) QUICK & EASY INSTALLATION - The wood kitchen drawer dividers are spring-loaded with excellent tension + padded at the ends with eva foam, keeping the bamboo drawer dividers tightly in place. Installation is a simple swipe, without scratching your furniture. STURDY CONSTRUCTION & EASY MAINTENANCE - Made from Sustainable quality bamboo, the drawer organizers are strong, long-lasting and easy to clean. The bamboo drawer organizer makes drawers look beautifully organized and will match almost any decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NfRTGZp3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bambüsi","source_asin":"B07NTMYY3R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NTMYY3R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NTMYY3R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":924084,"name":"Ailtio Silk Pillowcase - 100% Pure Mulberry Silk - 30 Momme 6A High-Grade Fibers - Satin Pillowcase for Hair & Skin - Regular, Queen & King Size Silk ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":82.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+D6osSDlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"30-MOMME 6A GRADE MULBERRY FIBERS: Ailtio Silk Pillowcases are handmade and crafted from high quality 30 Momme 100% Pure Mulberry Silk. We have spent countless hours prototyping, testing and using our products to ensure the highest quality and durability. TAKE YOUR HAIR FROM DRAB TO FAB: No more bedhead or tired hair! Kiss dryness and tangles goodbye! Ailtio prevents the tugging and pulling provided by ordinary pillowcases. Plus the non-absorbent surface helps to maintain your hair’s naturally producing oils. SKIN SAVING: Why waste time and money on a pillowcase that will only absorb vital skin nutrients? With Ailtio 100% Mulberry Silk, your skin will maintain the balanced moisture it needs to form a protective layer. Fight against dryness and acne, two sides of the same coin! BETTER & COOLER SLEEP: The temperature regulating properties of the Ailtio silk pillowcase allow you to keep cool at all times during the night without the discomfort associated with fluctuating temperature and the constant tossing and turning for a restful night sleep. GOODBYE ALLERGIES: While cotton is a veritable breeding ground for allergens, silk is totally hypoallergenic -- which means you can start waking up with clearer sinuses, dry eyes, and easy breathing. If you have sensitive skin, you’ll also notice less redness, puffiness, and blemishes when sleeping on a hypoallergenic surface like silk. 43% LESS FRICTION: Sleeping on Ailtio Silk alleviates pulling, tugging, and pressure on hair and skin. This reduction of friction results in smoother hair and creaseless, non-irritated skin. MOISTURE RETENTION: Pure Ailtio Silk is moisture wicking and helps regulate temperature without absorbing. The same natural features also allow your skin and hair to retain moisture and shine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+D6osSDlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AILTIO","source_asin":"B0BSGJRFQ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSGJRFQ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSGJRFQ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
