window.products.push({"id":924106,"name":"Microwave Steamer Cooker Collapsible Bowl-Silicone Steamer Cookware with Handle Lid for Vegetables Fish Prep Meal Food with Removable Rack BPA Free, E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MzZv6i61L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍅100% SAFE MATERIAL - Euchoiz vegetable steamer is made from high-quality food-grade silicone that can be high heat resistance up to 480°F. Steam your veggies quickly and easily without having to buy and throw steam bags. Best of all, we use the BPA Free & FBA approved material, always put you and your family's health at first. 🍅HEALTHIER COOKING WAY - Veggie steamer maximum retained the original protein, cellulose, vitamins, and minerals. Moreover, steamed food is digestible and helpful for gastrointestinal health. Perfect for steaming vegetables, fruit, meat, seafood, desserts and more. 🍅USER-FRIENDLY - Perfect time saving and space saving tool for traveling or camping or your everyday use. Silicone steamer cookware has a lid and a detachable insert. Just put a little bit of water in the bottom, cover your food with the lid, and let microwave steamer do the rest. Also, the silicone material is easy to clean and dishwasher safe. 🍅COLLAPSIBLE DESIGN - The collapsible design of the steamer bowl makes it easy to store. Besides, you can use it as a normal food prep containers, and if you press it down, it can be used as a plate. Our silicone steamer allows anyone to quickly and easily steam fresh or frozen vegetables for a quick, delicious, healthy meal. 🍅CHOOSE THE RIGHT SIZE - L:13.5\"*9.0\"*4.2\"; S:10.8\"*7.0\"*3.5\" The small size is enough for personal dinner. If you have a large family you can choose the large size, but make sure your microwave oven inner is large enough. We are dedicated to your satisfaction. If you're ever unsatisfied with the performance of the silicone microwave food steamer, please feel free to contact us at any time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MzZv6i61L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EuChoiz","source_asin":"B0897DM2VP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0897DM2VP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0897DM2VP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
