window.products.push({"id":924234,"name":"HUGOOD Nonstick Frying Pan Set - 3 Piece, PEEK Coating Non-stick Frying Pan Cookware, Skillet Set for Induction Cooktop, Gas, Electric,8 Inch, 9.5 Inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HFTAJ0ciL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍳The 3 piece frying pan set includes an 8 inch, 9.5 inch and 11 inch frying pans to fit you and your family’s varying cooking needs. 8-inch fry pan for quick, small tasks like eggs and pancakes; A 9.5-inch or 11-inch fry pan for cooking larger dishes or for family sizes; a stock pot for pasta and batch sauces and soup; and a small sauce pan for quick, easy tasks, deep enough to boil an egg, good for reheating and simmering. 🍳PEEK Coating Non-stick Frying Pan Cookware - HUGOOD fry pan beyond its non-stick qualities,non-stick coating has exceptional friction and abrasion resistance.This nonstick frying pan is 100% free of PFAS, PFOA, GenX, APEO, lead or cadmium. Stop worrying about harmful substances leaching into your food and harming your family's health. 🍳Multiple Use - Premium aluminum alloy material combined with magnetized base allows for rapid heat transfer and durability, suitable for use on cookware like induction, gas, ceramic, electric, halogen & solid fuel cookers. Not suitable for Oven. ★Also, the pans heat very quickly and do NOT need a high heat. 🍳Premium Aluminum - The professional grade aluminum makes the frying pan durable, light-weight and sturdy.Hugood frying pan offers good heat distribution and excellent maneuverability.Aluminum Construction make this pan's professional quality enables superior heat distribution and allows you to deliver a consistent product, enhancing food quality . It's also supremely lightweight for greater ease of use. 🍳Sturdy & riveted handle - This frying pan's handle is contoured for a comfortable hold in the hand.Handle minimizes heat build up to keep your hands safe from burns. To achieve the best results, use the pans at low to medium heat, do not heat the pan empty, don't allow oils to smoke.100% Satisfactory Guarantee: 30 days money back .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HFTAJ0ciL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUGOOD","source_asin":"B09QHX7R32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QHX7R32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QHX7R32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
