window.products.push({"id":924238,"name":"iFedio Toaster 2 Slice Stainless Steel Toasters with Removable Crumb Tray Toaster 2 Slice Best Rated Prime Two Slice Toaster + 7 Browning Setting, Sil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714pEnOK18L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Toaster 2 Slice Best Rated Prime with 7 Browning Settings + Quick Check/ Reheat/ Cancel/ Bagel/ Defrost Functions for Bagels, Waffles, Bread NOBLE AND ELEGANT DESIGN Toaster 2 Slice Best Rated Prime is made of high quality stainless steel with brushed metal texture. MULTI-FUNCTIONAL BUTTONS Two slice toaster with REHEAT/ CANCEL/ DEFROST/ BAGEL functions to meet your various toasting needs. UNIQUE FUNCTION QUICK CHECK During the baking process, you can check the baking degree at any time without interrupting its work. Lift the toaster’s lifting bar by hand from the bottom to the top. SATISFY A VARIETY OF TASTES Toaster 2 slice has 7 browning settings for light to darkness, rotate the buttom to choice the one you like (Recommended 3-5). KEEP COUNTERTOPS CLEAN Bread crumbs are collected in a removable crumb tray at the bottom of the stainless steel toaster. KEEP COUNTERTOPS TIDY The power cord can be stored underneath the toaster 2 slice while not in use to keep your counter tidy. ACCELERATED COOLING The toaster has been upgraded with heat dissipation to protect the body and extend the life of toasters (It's normal for toasters to get hot when baking). EXTRA-WIDE SLOT Toaster 2 Slice Best Rated Prime featured with 1.5-inch wide slot, making it suitable for various bread types. TOASTER SPECIFICATION Name: 2 Slice Toaster Brand: iFedio Model: ST-230-UL Material: Stainless Steel Rated Voltage: 120V Rated Power: 900W Hertz: 60Hz ABOUT US We'll try our best to solve your problem!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714pEnOK18L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iFedio","source_asin":"B08PXQQ97X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PXQQ97X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PXQQ97X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":924239,"name":"Vacu Vin Wine and Champagne Bottle Snap Thermometer - Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TxkD2eFpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wine and champagne should be served at a temperature that compliments its unique bouquet and flavor profile. The optimal temperature varies for different types of wine and champagne and is dependent upon factors such as the grape variety used and where the drink originates from. The Vacu Vin Wine and Champagne Snap Thermometer allows users to easily see the temperature of both wine and champagne without opening the bottle. The flexible band is simply 'snapped' onto the outside of the bottle; it then displays the temperature in color on a black screen at the front of the thermometer. The Snap Thermometer is designed so that it will snap around any wine and champagne bottle, regardless of its size and shape. It features an index of suggested serving temperatures for a variety of wines (Chardonnay, Merlot, Sauvignon etc) and champagnes on its rear side. The Snap Thermometer is highly durable and can be used over and over again. It can be easily cleaned with hot water and dish soap. Vacu Vin was established in 1986 in Delft, the Netherlands. For over 30 years this family-owned company has evolved into the leading brand within the housewares industry, offering an array of barware accessories and kitchen gadgets that are characterized by their quality and innovative functionality. Vacu Vin’s product portfolio also includes award-winning Wine Coolers, Pineapple Slicers and other gadgets now used in over 35 million households and more than 80 countries throughout the world. A specialist, European in-house design team are constantly striving to add new items to the company’s ever-evolving product portfolio to satisfy the demands of the savvy, modern-day consumer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TxkD2eFpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vacu Vin","source_asin":"B079M92Z9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079M92Z9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079M92Z9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
