window.products.push({"id":924259,"name":"Alchemy Gothic Nevermore Fob Watch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616bX3kpFLL._AC_SL1127_.jpg","description":"If you want a one of a kind \"WOW\" piece, Alchemy Gothic is the place to get it. Not only are you getting a unique and quality product, but a finely detailed and crafted piece of timeless artwork.  From the Fall 2014 Collection, Alchemy England 1977 presents its extraordinary designs of the Coronation of Coraxia. From and early 16th Century ceiling painting discovered in a small underground chapel at Einsiedeln Abbey, Schwyz, this catalog selection depicts the investiture of the Corvus Regina, or Raven Queen where in the ancient, intoxicated pagan ceremony, Furavis, son of Orcus, crowns the princess with a black rose diadem and bestows upon her the dark secrets of Prophecy and Divinity.   The metal used in the manufacture of all Alchemy’s pewter products is the highest grade “English Pewter”. Some manufacturers misleadingly use the term ‘pewter’ to describe alloys containing lead. This results in inferior, more easily made products which are heavier, softer and of a darker color and are much more prone to tarnishing and disfigurement. English Pewter is the finest grade of pewter, to BSEN611-1:1995 standard. Traditionally, pewter was a mixture of lead and tin, but today, English pewter is a rich, high-grade alloy of 92% tin with copper (plus a few legitimate trace elements), and is regarded as a ‘semi-precious’ metal valued second only to silver. English Pewter is very much harder to craft than zinc alloys and the old and primate forms of pewter, which contain significant amounts of toxic impurities which ease production. So beware of other manufacturers who do not have our high standards.   Pewter, like silver, may tarnish, but can easily be polished up to a brilliant lustrous shine, using a brass or silver polishing wad and wipe with a dry cloth. DO NOT put pewter into a salt-loaded dishwasher, which could corrode a polished surface. Alchemy will gladly replace any product proven to be defective.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616bX3kpFLL._AC_SL1127_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dear Deceased","source_asin":"B002V03EWI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002V03EWI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002V03EWI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":924260,"name":"The Friendly Swede Microfiber Towels for Sports, Gym, Yoga, Travel, Swim, Hiking and Camping, Ultralight and Quick Drying","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wnF74ElDL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","description":"Microfiber Machine Wash ✅ GREAT FOR SPORTS & TRAVEL: Our Microfiber Towels are highly absorbent, soft and ensure a comfortable, quick drying experience. These ultralight towels are perfect for use as swim towels, gym towels, beach towels or travel towels. If you're borrowing mats during practice, the towel also adds a hygienic layer. ✅ ULTRA LIGHTWEIGHT AND SPACE SAVING: The towels are lightweight and compact. Easy to bring on your travel, hiking or camping and doesn’t take much space in your bag. 2 additional mesh bags are great for storing the ultra-thin towels and will keep them fresh when packed. ✅ HIGH QUALITY AND SUPER ABSORBENT: The Friendly Swede's towels use an 80/20 polyester-polyamide microfiber blend that is durable, soft and highly absorbent. ✅ BUNDLE OF 4 ITEMS: Includes a total of 2 towels (1 x light grey towel and 1 x Sea blue towel; 20\" x 40\" respectively 50 x 100 cm) and 2 mesh carrying bags. Weight of each towel is 3.8 oz (109 g). ✅ MACHINE WASHABLE: Wash before first use! Wash separately the first 3-4 times as color may bleed. Do not use bleach or fabric softener or wash with cotton. The Friendly Swede’s LIFETIME WARRANTY covers this product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wnF74ElDL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Friendly Swede","source_asin":"B06XSM1B5K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XSM1B5K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XSM1B5K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
