window.products.push({"id":924267,"name":"Lemon Tiered Tray Decor Artificial Wooden Fruit - Yellow Lemons, Green Limes Fake Faux Mini Fruits Slices Leaves - Lemon Sign Block Decor for Table Ce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613TqZx74CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Fun, Fresh Touch You’ve Been Looking ForMaybe you feel like decorating for summer or maybe you just love citrus fruits’ cheerful vibe. Either way, JoiFey has just the thing for you: set of 7 artificial limes, lemons, and leaves. Crafted with wood, your set adds vibrant, joyous character to any room. Complete your home with JoiFey!Take a Look Inside Your SetPlace a lime here, a leaf there. Your set includes 7 beautiful pieces to mix and match:– 1 whole lemon (2.75x2.75x0.65 in.)– 1 whole lime (2.75x2.75x0.65 in.)– 1 half lemon slice (2.75x1.35x0.65 in.)– 1 half lime slice (2.75x1.35x0.65 in.)– 3 leaves (2x0.7x0.65 in.)Add a Splash of Summertime to Any SpaceLiven any room in your home with your wooden lemons and limes!– Create a playful, lemon- and lime-themed tiered tray to spruce your kitchen or beverage bar.– Add some zest to your table for everyday or special occasions by using your fake lemon and lime bundle as a centerpiece.– Brighten your window sill, bookcase, or counter with a collage of decorative lemons, limes, and leaves.– Fill a small basket or wooden box with your fake fruit slices and whole fruits for a farmhouse-inspired decoration.– Complete your summertime- or lemon-themed pool party, baby shower, or bridal shower with your festive JoiFey lemon decor.When Loved Ones Give You These Lemons, You SmileSearching for a fun apartment or housewarming gift? Delight your loved one with a set of faux fruit decor from JoiFey! With its decorative possibilities and irresistible cuteness, this set is the perfect gift.Why Choose Wood?Plastic faux fruits not only tend to smash but also can look a little tacky. That’s why we craft your artificial fruit slices, whole fruit, and leaves with wood—for years-long durability and classic style.Make your space feel brighter and more yours. Grab your own set of wooden lemons and limes from JoiFey!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613TqZx74CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JoiFey","source_asin":"B09TWWTMMX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TWWTMMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TWWTMMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
