window.products.push({"id":924372,"name":"Valley of Rain & Forest Long-Lasting Natural Flowers, Floral Gift for You to Send Love for All Occasions, for Indoor Decoration (Light Blue Carnation,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hZDf1ig8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♥100% natural flowers that last for 3-5 years♥: They, including all small flowers, are natural flowers cut at their most beautiful moment and preserved by maintaining their original suppleness, shape, brightness. They can last for 3 to 5 years, allowing you to have fresh flowers without daily watering or maintenance and enjoy their blooming beauty every day. ♥A \"sweet\" gift to make her feel loved♥: If you're searching for a meaningful gift for someone special in your life, consider the beauty & symbolism of carnations & roses. They've long been associated with love & affection, making them a \"sweet\" choice for anyone you hold dear. Seeing your loved one light up with happiness is a priceless feeling, and these flowers have the ability to evoke those emotions. Plus, their long life span can serve as a lasting reminder of your love & appreciation. ♥Comes with all you need for a gift♥: They come packaged in a nice-looking gift box, containing everything you need to make your gift special. The box includes three batteries to power the lights, so your recipient can enjoy the lighted effect of the flowers during the night. It also comes with a greeting card that allows you to write down what is deep down inside your heart, and best wishes for the recipient. With this special gift, you can show your loved one just how much they mean to you. ♥Decoration that evokes positive feelings♥: Having these flowers in your space not only enhances its appearance but can also have a positive impact on your mood and creativity. The presence of natural elements can make you feel more connected to the environment and uplift your spirits. So, incorporating flowers in your surroundings can be a wonderful way to improve both the aesthetics and ambiance of your space. ♥Why Choose Us♥: Every flower is made by hand and heart and examined carefully to ensure you get quality flowers, and to make sure you get what you expect we display the flowers with real photos. You are more than welcome to send us feedback and suggestions through which we can serve you better in the future. ♥Please note♥: 1. Due to the delicateness of natural flowers, removing the glass dome is not recommended as it can lead to unintended damage to the flowers. If the dome needs to be taken off, it is important to be mindful of the possibility of crushing the flowers a little bit during the process of putting it back. 2. Since these are real flowers crafted by hand and not mass-produced by machine, there may be slight variations in certain cases.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hZDf1ig8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Valley of Rain & Forest","source_asin":"B0BFM3VR82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFM3VR82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFM3VR82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
