window.products.push({"id":924555,"name":"Precious Moments 201014 Cheers to A Sweet Holiday Annual Elf Bisque Porcelain Ornament, Multicolored","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BArCpPs9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The holidays are for continuing the sweetest traditions! The fifth introduction to the Annual Elf Series, this elf peeks out of a cocoa cup, ready to great the season with some oversized peppermint sticks! Delightful details abound, from the jingle bell on the end of her hat to the festive tree and snowflake designs around the mug. The perfect present for any Precious Moments fan or collector of elf-themed Christmas décor, give this whimsical ornament as a unique and thoughtful Christmas gift to friends, family, teachers, coworkers, or anyone you’d like to wish a sweet season. It’s perfect for hanging on a tree or tying on to packages. Measuring approximately 2.75”H, this special ornament has been meticulously crafted of fine bisque porcelain and is expertly hand-painted by highly trained artisans. For more than 40 years, Precious Moments has been devoted to making the world a kinder place by helping people share love. A timeless brand, Precious Moments helps you celebrate everyday moments and commemorate special occasions with hand-painted porcelain figurines and ornaments as well as contemporary kitchenware, home décor, baby gifts, and more. A unique inspirational message lies at the heart of every Precious Moments product, thoughtfully designed so you can turn your special moments into memories that last a lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BArCpPs9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Precious Moments","source_asin":"B084XSZ1N5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084XSZ1N5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084XSZ1N5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
