window.products.push({"id":924649,"name":"PaulDesigns Jasmine Ornament - Aladdin Ornament Christmas - Funny Jasmine Ornament for Kid for Kids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ntTrsai5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Ornament will be sure to be the perfect keepsake for you and your loved ones this holiday season. We provide several different kinds of designs, which make amazing gift ideas for husband, boyfriend, wife, girlfriend, grandparent, and more! The design is permanently printed on both sides onto a flat round ceramic ornament which approximately measures 2.85”. Ornament includes a gold ribbon loop for hanging. Each ornament is packed in a special bubble bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ntTrsai5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PaulDesigns","source_asin":"B0BLW5ZGX2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLW5ZGX2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLW5ZGX2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":924650,"name":"nuLOOM Jenson Braided Tassel Wool Area Rug, 6 ft x 9 ft, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":222.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1NNEmRj5PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At nuLOOM, we believe that floor coverings and art should not be mutually exclusive. Founded with a desire to break the rules of what is expected from an area rug, nuLOOM was created to fill the void between brilliant design and affordability., The images we display have the most accurate colors possible.Rug Colors, sizes, patterns may vary slightly depending on how your rug is made and the size ordered.Due to different monitor resolutions and lighting you may notice a slight difference in color. Each handmade rug is unique to the artisan who weaved it.These are not considered defects Bunching, Creases and Folded Corners: You may see some creases and bunching in the pile and around the corners when you unroll your new rug. These waves will flatten within 2 -3 weeks as you begin to use your new rug. Use these tricks to help flatten your rug: Back Rolling: Roll the carpet out, then roll it back up reversely with the backside up. Let it sit rolled up reversely for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. Heavy Objects: Lay a piece of heavy furniture or objects on affected areas for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. If the corners are sticking up, curl them back and place heavy objects on affected areas going the opposite way. Heat: Use this technique as a last resort only. Place the rug over a cleared concrete or area like a driveway or sidewalk setting during dry sunny conditions. Allow the rug to be positioned for optimal sunlight as long as possible to give the rug time to absorb the sun's heat for up to 2 hours, but use more time if needed. Blow Dryer: If a large concrete patch with optimal sunlight is not accessible, flip the rug over and use a hair dryer to affected areas to heat up the creases. Always hold the hair dryer 7 to 12 inches away from the rug going side to side on a medium setting, as heat can sometimes cause backing to melt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1NNEmRj5PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nuLOOM","source_asin":"B08YKKDM7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YKKDM7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YKKDM7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
