window.products.push({"id":924688,"name":"LAWA FURNITURE Kid's Study Desk with Bookshelf + 2 Stools for Ages 3-8, Wooden Children Activity Table with Hutch and Shelves, Kids Bedroom Study Desk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IX0BWNQLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY DESK: Our kid’s desk is constructed from safe and durable engineered wood. All materials used in the production comply with environmental and children’s health standards. The children’s activity desk is produced using 18mm thick melamine coated chipboards, it is produced from European E1 quality standards particleboards that are harmless to health. The fasteners, handles, screws, and accessories used in our products are the first quality like all other materials. GREAT ACTIVITY PLACE for KIDS: The wooden children’s activity table provides you with a large space for activity and storage. The splendid width of the whole product is 70 Inches and the width for the desk is 47 Inches which will enable you for tons of activities. Our Children’s Desk includes 5 shelves on the sides and 1 Hutch over the desk. Kids will be able to read, draw and write on the desk. Your kids will have the space to store, organize and pin their books, notes, and pictures. AMPLE STORAGE SPACE: Our desk for kids has 9 surfaces to use for storage. 5 cabinets on the edges 1 hutch over the desk and the desk itself. You could utilize the top surfaces of the shelves as well. ADEQUATE SIZE for KIDS: The kid’s study desk includes 5 shelves, a desk, and 2 stools. Desk size: 47.24\"L x 17.71\"W x 20.47\"H, Stool Size: 13.77\"L x 11.81\"W x 11.81\"H. The general length from the right shelf to the left shelf is 70.86 inches, the height of the right shelf is 36.85 inches and the height of the left shelf is 27 inches. PERFECT GIFT for CHILDREN: Lawa Kid’s Study Desk will be the perfect gift for your kids. They will have bonds with the desk since they will do tons of activities on and around it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IX0BWNQLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAWA FURNITURE","source_asin":"B0BJW3Z37H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJW3Z37H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJW3Z37H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":924689,"name":"Ice Cube Tray for Freezer with Lid 2 Pack, Sphere Ice Cube Mold Reusable Silicone Base IceCube Trays Molds Easy-Release Form for Chilled Whiskey, Cock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rebkvGyXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique Round Ball Ice Cube Trays】: The ice balls tray adopts a unique design, A sphere consisting of multiple hexagonal faces. Ice balls tray ​combo allows you to make 12 ice balls each time. The unique whiskey ice balls are suitable for chilling your drink quickly ^^ 【Premium TPE /Silicone Base Design 】: Unlike the traditional silicone ice trays, these sphere Ice cube mold bottom uses a combination of premium TPE and Silicone materials. The premium plastic tray makes it easy to move and place when filled with water. The flexible silicone base mold design, adopting a press structure to make it easier to release sphere ice cubes. With no need for clumsy bending or twisting without force. They are fantastic round ice cube trays ^^ 【Easy to Fill / Better Sealing】: Direct injection under the max water line and close the cover. Say goodbye to using a tiny funnel to fill water. Each ice ball maker with a removable lid for sealing, No longer worries about liquid leakage! And keeps your ice cube transparent, odor-free, dust-free. Also allows you to stack the ice trays and save freezer space, enjoy your ice-cool drink ^^ 【Simple Use 4 Steps】: 1. Pour water and fruits into each grid of the ice tray to the water line; 2. Put the lid on, the small hole will overflow the excess water; 3. Put it in the fridge steadily until completely frozen; 4. Please wait 30 seconds after you take the ice tray sout from the fridge, or flush the bottom (silicone part) for 3-5seconds. It will be easier to release the ice cubes. Gently push the bottom to release the ice cube from the trays ^^ 【Slow Melting Ice Cubes】: Spherical ice trays are perfect for summer delicacies, such as whisky, cocktails, coffee, mojito, impregnated fruit or vanilla, puddings and more. Because the ice hockey composed of multiple hexagonal surfaces will melt slowly are perfect to keep your drinks cold. It’s really a must for iced drinks and holiday gifts. If you have any questions, please feel free to consult us. Thanks ^^","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rebkvGyXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tilasickel","source_asin":"B09YRJJ9TN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YRJJ9TN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YRJJ9TN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
