window.products.push({"id":924772,"name":"Light My Fire Reusable Straws - Reusable Plastic Straws - 4 pcs - BPA Free Travel Straw - Large Reusable Straws for Smoothies - Lunch Box Straw - Stra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jgNgVgFsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SET OF 4 REUSABLE PLASTIC STRAWS - Convenient straw for drinking and stirring. The perfect zero waste alternative to disposable plastic straws. The size of this eco-friendly straw is also ideal for travel, camping vacations, barbecues, picnics, hikes or just your daily lunch breaks. Our straws are made from bio-based bioplastic and can be used over and over again. Easy cleaning in the dishwasher. AN ORIGINAL DESIGN - Our reusable plastic straw is oval shaped with a non-slip handle. A wide straw makes it easy to drink all kind of liquids. Perfect as a reusable drinking straw for hot and cold drinks such as water, milkshakes, coffee, but also as a smoothie straw. The wider opening makes it easy to consume yogurt, smoothies or cold soups with pieces of fruits inside. EXTRA WIDE STRAWS MADE OF BIO BASED PLASTICS FROM PLANTS - This set of drinking straws is entirely made of plastics from plants. It is an excellent substitute to fossil fuel based straws. Light My Fire's tableware products are all made in Sweden in our own factory and the plastic material used is always bio based. The plastic is always 100% BPA free which makes this product completely safe for you and your children. This straws are made of sugar cane and wood fibers. PACKAGE CONTENT - Kit of 4 reusable straws including 4 x \"ReStraw\" each 6.7 Inch long. Colors: pink, yellow, blue and green. Ecological, sustainable and compostable. Eco-Plastic Straw BPA free. The straws are safe to go on the microwave and dishwasher. PICNIC STRAWS PRODUCED IN SWEDEN - Light My Fire is a Swedish brand that creates products that reconnect us with nature, wherever we are. No matter which product you choose, its design, color and function are just as attractive and work in the city as in the wild. All plastic parts are made from bio-based plastics - for a more sustainable future. Light My Fire produces all their camping mess kits, fire starters and cooking and eating utensils in their facility in Sweden.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jgNgVgFsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Light my Fire","source_asin":"B0C7K87GR9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7K87GR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7K87GR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
