window.products.push({"id":924821,"name":"TJ's Macadamia Nut Cracker, Garden, Lawn, Maintenance","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LG2tolKyL._AC_.jpg","description":"You have tried the rest. Now try the Best. This cracker was specially designed for use with the macadamia nuts. However TJ's nutcracker will crack any nut that fits in it's jaws. Macadamia nuts have the toughest shell found on Earth but with this cracker, all nuts have met their match. Other crackers require physical strength to crack the nut. TJs Nut cracker works with leverage. This cracker is so easy to operate a 2 year old can do it . Don't be fooled by cheap versions or think your hand held cracker can do the job of cracking Macadamia nuts. You will end up with a sore hand and broken cracker after a few nuts. NOTE ABOUT CRACKING ABILITY This will crack your nuts. Please be aware that \"cleanliness\" of your crack has to due with the quality of your nut, not this cracker.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LG2tolKyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Garden-Outdoor","source_asin":"B00GSW1IHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GSW1IHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GSW1IHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
