window.products.push({"id":924865,"name":"Utheer Gas Fireplace Logs, 6pcs Gas Logs for All Type Fireplace and Fire Pit, Firebowl, Vented, Gel, Ventless, Electric, Gas Inserts, Weathered Cerami","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q+NuCXYzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥【Dimension】▶Each log is approximately 6.69'' to 19.48'' long x 1.77'' to 5.11'' in diameter.【Determine The Size Of Fireplce】▶To get the perfect look, it’s important to choose the size gas fireplace logs set that best fits in your fireplace.This simple measuring process will help you choose the right size, please measure the front and the back width of you fireplace, the depth from the front to the back of your fireplace, the depth from the front to the back of your fireplace before purchasing 🔥【Prevent Gas Logs Turning Black】▶ Gas fireplace logs can be used exclusively or placed on top of a base layer of fire rock or Gas Fireplace Embers or sand to prevent turning black. Do not use the gas fireplace logs with real burning logs, they will release ash that may make the gas log turn black. We recommend that there is enough space between the burner and the gas logs, you can also match with fire glass, glowing embers to make your fireplace fire pit more artistic 🔥【Super Realistic】▶ The gas logs for fireplace are made of a special material called ceramic fiber, it can sustain high temperature, which can keep fire logs in a good shape, won't burn itself. lt also doesn't create toxic fumes, soot or ash in the fire. Give you a health environment. ► Be sure to leave at least 1.5 inches between the logs and your gas orafices. Blocking these orafices is what causes incomplete gas combustion 🔥【Perfect Fits】 ▶ Fireplace logs have a natural and realistic look, they are good decorations, add a modern look to your fireplace and fire pit. Birch fireplace logs fit for Vented gas fireplace, Outdoor gas fireplaces, indoor gas fireplaces, direct vent, zero clearance, natural gas, gel, standard fire pits, fake fireplaces, electric fireplace inserts, propane fireplaces, etc 🔥【Easy to Maintain】▶ As the fireplace gas logs don't produce ash and charcoal when burning, so they are easy to maintain. You can clean it annually. 【Packing List】▶ The gas logs set including 6pcs natural gas logs with different designs to allow you to use your creativity","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q+NuCXYzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Utheer","source_asin":"B099WSBXQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-924865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099WSBXQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099WSBXQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
